ng massive Ether DMG.\n    * **[NEW]** Activating this skill counts as activating a [Quick Assist].\n    * **[NEW]** Provides all squad members with a [Robin Shield] equal to **4%** of this character's initial Max HP, lasting **20s**.\n    * *(Lv. 12)* DMG Multiplier: **2128.8%** | Daze Multiplier: **264%**\n\n* **Quick Assist** **[Robin Assist]:**\n    * **[NEW]** When the active character is launched, press to activate:\n    * **[NEW]** Swing the staff to attack enemies in front, dealing Ether DMG.\n    * **[NEW]** Character is invulnerable while using this skill.\n    * *(Lv. 12)* DMG Multiplier: **74.8%** | Daze Multiplier: **44.8%**\n\n* **Defensive Assist** **[Robin Defensive Assist]:**\n    * **[NEW]** When the on-field character is about to be attacked, press to activate:\n    * **[NEW]** Parries the enemy's attack, dealing massive Daze.\n    * **[NEW]** Character is invulnerable while using this skill.\n    * *(Lv. 12)* Light Defensive Daze Multiplier: **407.7%** | Heavy Defensive Daze Multiplier: **514.4%** | Chain Defensive Daze Multiplier: **250.4%**\n\n* **Assist Follow-Up** **[Robin Assist Follow-Up]:**\n    * **[NEW]** Press after a Defensive Assist to activate:\n    * **[NEW]** Swing the staff to attack enemies in front, dealing Ether DMG.\n    * **[NEW]** Character is invulnerable while using this skill.\n    * *(Lv. 12)* DMG Multiplier: **919.1%** | Daze Multiplier: **470.6%**\n\n* **Counter Assist** **[Robin Counter]:**\n    * **[NEW]** When you or the on-field character is about to be hit by certain enemies' Control Skills, press to activate:\n    * **[NEW]** Engage in a power clash with the monster. If successful, neutralize the enemy's Control Skill and deal Ether DMG.\n    * **[NEW]** Character is invulnerable while using this skill.\n    * *(Lv. 12)* DMG Multiplier: **268.4%** | Daze Multiplier: **71%**"
